---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import RuledRows from './RuledRows.astro';
// Move 5. Six times a check of ours passed for a reason unrelated to the fix
// being correct, each in the flattering direction. Number verified against the
// blind-run report's "Six times" list (methodology notes 4, 6, 7, 9, 12, 12).
const bugs = [
  { lead: 'The app that would not start', body: 'A patch that failed to boot scored as a patch that shut the hole, because every attack failed to connect and every failed connection read as a blocked attack.' },
  { lead: 'The guard that read the wrong tree', body: 'A pre-publication leak guard reported clean about the working tree while the answer key sat in an earlier commit, public forever.' },
  { lead: 'The claim that was not in the code', body: 'A published note claimed a verification that did not exist in the scorer.' },
  { lead: 'The correct fix we failed', body: 'Our own alert check failed a correct allow-list fix, because an allow-list cannot remove the pattern the rule matches.' },
  { lead: 'The corpus that named its answer', body: 'The vulnerable modules carried comments naming the flaw and the fix, so every tool had been handed the answer.' },
  { lead: 'The guard that was right by its own definition', body: 'A leak guard searched for payloads and fix code and found none, while explanatory prose describing the flaw walked straight past it.' },
];
---

<Section id="credibility">
  <h2 class="h2 reveal" style="max-width:22ch">Six times, our own check was wrong.</h2>

  <p class="reveal mt-8 text-[17px] leading-[1.6]" style="--reveal-delay:60ms;max-width:66ch">
    Each passed for a reason unrelated to the fix being correct, and every one failed in the
    flattering direction. A check that wrongly accuses a good patch is investigated within the
    hour; a check that wrongly clears a bad one is the answer nobody interrogates. All six are
    written up in full.
  </p>

  <div class="reveal mt-11" style="--reveal-delay:60ms;max-width:80ch">
    <RuledRows label="Found and closed, in the methodology notes" rows={bugs} />
  </div>

  <p class="reveal mt-8">
    <a href="/methodology" class="link-inline text-[15px] font-medium">
      How each was found and closed
    </a>
  </p>
</Section>
